        "Test"
      ],
      "rationale": "The requirement specifies a behavioral response (immediate fulfillment) to a specific input condition (absence of start sub-conditions) which must be observed by executing the system."
    },
    {
      "requirement_id": "ETC-102",
      "methods": [
        "Test"
